"sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-gw7nds","name":"Nathan Lambert：Interconnects（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z"}],"sectionLabel":"开源模型性能逼近闭源旗舰","reportSummary":"开源模型生态正日益依赖 Nvidia 的资助，其已投入 260 亿美元推动近乎开源的模型开发，以扩大推理芯片需求。若此路径不奏效，开源模型将转向效率、可修改性等长尾场景，与闭源模型分化。同时，基础模型训练门槛升高，开源社区兴趣正从全量训练转向对 DeepSeek V4 Flash、GLM 5.X 等模型的微调。","reportEdition":"2026-08-17","reportKind":"weekly"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","title":"OpenAI 在“关键网络能力”时代放缓模型开发节奏","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T11:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","https://openai.com/index/pacing-model-development-cyber-capabilities"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","title":"OpenAI 在“关键网络能力”时代放缓模型开发节奏","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 因 OpenAI-Hugging Face 事件及即将推出的 Astra 模型可能达到《预备框架》下的“关键网络安全能力”阈值，暂时放缓了模型扩展速度，包括暂停最新部署模型的强化学习训练两周，并搁置最大规模前沿 RL 运行。公司已加强研究环境安全，要求对 Astra 及网络相关负载实施最严格防护，并扩展思维链监控，采用多阶段激活分类器检测机制。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","originalUrl":"https://openai.com/index/pacing-model-development-cyber-capabilities","publishedAt":"2026-08-18T11:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-08-18T11:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1wljf9q","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：官网动态（RSS · 排除企业/客户案例）","family":"openai","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"AI 安全与治理成为焦点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsz0hbsg05l0ro204080cotv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-11T19:51:46.715Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"pr